printing.sizing_note = Maitiro ekukwanisa anoronga mufananidzo mukati mesero rimwe nerimwe asina kucheka. Saizi chaiyo inoshandisa DPI yegwaro; deredza mitsara kana makoramu egiridhi kana usingakwani. Dhinda PDF pa100% usina kusarudza kukwanisa peji.
