printing.invalid = Marongero ekudhinda kana zviyero zvemufananidzo hazvina kunaka.
printing.limit = Basa rekudhinda rapfuura muganhu: mifananidzo 200, mapikiseri mamiriyoni 40 kana mapikiseri 32768 padivi rimwe nerimwe pamufananidzo, kana 256 MiB yedata rePDF rakatsindirwa.
printing.profile_error = Mufananidzo uyu une purofaira yeruvara isiri iyo, isingaenderani nawo kana isingatsigirwi. Gwaro rine makwara eruvara eCMYK/Lab chaiwo rinoda purofaira yakaiswa mukati uye inoshanda; RGB inoda purofaira yeRGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Mufananidzo paDPI yegwaro racho haukwani musero iri. Shandisa maitiro ekukwanisa, giridhi ine mitsara kana makoramu mashoma, kana pepa rakakura.
printing.caption_limit = Chinyorwa chemufananidzo chakareba zvakawandisa pagiridhi iri. Shandisa mitsara kana makoramu mashoma, pfupisa chinyorwa kana kudzima zvinyorwa zvemifananidzo.
printing.font_error = Hapana fonti iripo yechinyorwa chemufananidzo. Isa fonti yemavara kana kudzima zvinyorwa zvemifananidzo.
printing.no_document = Vhura gwaro kana sarudza mafoto emagalari usati wadhinda.
printing.source_error = Pikicha yakasarudzwa, faira repadivi rine zvakagadziridzwa, kana chinyorwa chemufananidzo hazvina kukwanisa kuverengwa. Hapana PDF yachengetwa.
printing.save_error = PDF yatadza kuchengetwa. Sarudza zita idzva refaira muforodha yaunogona kunyorera; mafaira aripo haambotsiviwi.
printing.downloaded = PDF yadhaunirodhwa. Ivhure muchiverengi chePDF kuti uidinde pa100%.
